  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Danida Sustanable Infrastructure Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Danida Sustainable Infrastructure Finance (DSIF) 2002-2020. The evaluation of DSIF serves learning sand accountability purposes for IFU/DSIF and MFA and covers the evaluation period since the first evaluation in 2001. The evaluation focuses on outcomes of the support as well as the envisaged future role of DSIF in Danish development cooperation, and whether DSIF is a good fit for partner country institutions in jointly working for the realization of the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
